        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift, Nathan Chapman\n- Companies: Big Machine Records\n- Products: \"Fifteen\", Fearless, Taylor Swift\n- Concepts: country pop, singles, studio albums, record production\n\nFacts:\n- Fearless is the second studio album by American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift.\n- Taylor Swift wrote or co-wrote all thirteen tracks on Fearless, as she had done on her first album, Taylor Swift.\n- Taylor Swift made her debut as a record producer on Fearless by co-producing all songs with Nathan Chapman.\n- \"Fifteen\" is a country pop song performed by American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift.\n- Big Machine Records released \"Fifteen\" on August 30, 2009 as the fourth single from Taylor Swift's second studio album, Fearless (2008).",
